WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.569
Alright, welcome to
my "Quiplash" game.

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:03.970
Tonight we're playing with
Kenan Thompson,

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:07.273
Whitney Cummings,
and Melissa Villaseñor!

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:08.742
-Whoo-whoo!

00:00:08.742 --> 00:00:11.210
-Thank you, guys, so much
for playing this.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:12.778
Here's how the game works
for everyone at home.

00:00:12.778 --> 00:00:14.914
On our phones we're going to
get a series of

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:17.183
fill-in-the-blank style
prompts like,

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:20.820
"A good name for a pirate
singles bar is blank."

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.222
Then we'll each secretly type on
our phone the funniest answer

00:00:23.222 --> 00:00:25.058
that we can think of
on the spot.

00:00:25.058 --> 00:00:27.227
When we're done, two answers
will go head-to-head

00:00:27.227 --> 00:00:29.395
on the screen and the other
players will vote

00:00:29.395 --> 00:00:31.764
for whichever answer
they think is funnier.

00:00:31.764 --> 00:00:34.467
The more votes your answer gets,
the more points you get.

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:37.570
But we won't know whose answer
it is until after we vote.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.371
-I'm so confused.
I'm so confused.

00:00:39.371 --> 00:00:40.773
-You ready?
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:41.941
-I'm lost. I'm so lost.

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:44.010
-Alright, do you guys
have your devices?

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.978
-Yes.
-Everyone can play this at home.

00:00:45.978 --> 00:00:48.648
Not right now, but you can play
your own version of the game.

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:51.483
Alright, let's start the game.
Let's "Quiplash"!

00:00:51.483 --> 00:00:55.755
Alright, everybody in?

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:57.056
Here we go, guys.

00:00:57.056 --> 00:00:58.324
Good luck to everyone.

00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:00.059
This is our "Quiplash."
Here we go.

00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:01.594
-Let's do it.

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:03.228
-Alright, now you get a question
on your phone

00:01:03.228 --> 00:01:04.697
that no one else can see,

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:07.767
so you just answer the questions
that come on your phone screen.

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:09.601
For people at home,
I'll fast-forward this part

00:01:09.601 --> 00:01:10.669
so it won't be as boring.

00:01:10.669 --> 00:01:11.704
Alright.
-Ah, okay.

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:13.406
-Round one guys.
Good luck. Here we go!

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:16.675
Round one! I'm feeling good!

00:01:16.675 --> 00:01:18.711
Alright.
-I'm nervous!

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:20.847
-Me too. So am I. I'm sweating.

00:01:20.847 --> 00:01:24.517
♪♪

00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:27.019
I mean, how mean are we
allowed to be here?

00:01:27.019 --> 00:01:30.523
[ Laughs ]

00:01:30.523 --> 00:01:32.858
Melissa!

00:01:32.858 --> 00:01:35.995
-You know what?
I love this game.

00:01:35.995 --> 00:01:40.299
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.299 --> 00:01:42.669
-Alright. Everyone's in!
Everyone's in!

00:01:42.669 --> 00:01:44.336
Alright, come on.
-Okay, okay.

00:01:44.336 --> 00:01:46.372
-Alright, here we go.
Everyone's answers are locked.

00:01:46.372 --> 00:01:48.208
We don't know. Here we go.

00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:49.842
And this is the game "Quiplash."

00:01:49.842 --> 00:01:51.978
Alright, "The Wright Brothers'
first words after flying

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:54.146
for the first time were..."

00:01:54.146 --> 00:01:56.348
"Damn, Daniel."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.348 --> 00:02:01.187
Or "I got to change my undies."

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:02.422
-Damn, Daniel.

00:02:02.422 --> 00:02:08.828
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.828 --> 00:02:12.131
-Alright.

00:02:12.131 --> 00:02:13.799
I knew I got --
No one even remembers.

00:02:13.799 --> 00:02:16.435
-Whoo-hoo! Kenan!

00:02:16.435 --> 00:02:18.470
-No one remembers
"Damn, Daniel!"

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:21.307
-I remember "Damn, Daniel."
That's a good one.

00:02:21.307 --> 00:02:25.578
-"Alvin and the Chipmunks 12."

00:02:25.578 --> 00:02:27.846
Get out of my undies,
you chipmunks."

00:02:27.846 --> 00:02:30.483
-Lot of undies talk.
-I know.

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:31.617
-"Even more buck."

00:02:31.617 --> 00:02:34.654
Is buck --
-Like buckteeth?

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:38.457
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:38.457 --> 00:02:41.794
I thought that was
a character from the movie.

00:02:41.794 --> 00:02:43.863
I thought Buck was the manager.

00:02:43.863 --> 00:02:46.599
-Oh, it's a --
-It's a 50/50 split.

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:49.769
Nice.
-Close game.

00:02:49.769 --> 00:02:51.204
No love for me yet.

00:02:51.204 --> 00:02:54.907
"A good way to get kicked out of
a jazz band"?

00:02:54.907 --> 00:02:57.343
"Blessing the audience
with sax spit."

00:02:57.343 --> 00:02:58.778
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.778 --> 00:03:00.546
-In this climate?

00:03:00.546 --> 00:03:03.082
-"Show your pee-pee
in the recording studio."

00:03:03.082 --> 00:03:04.550
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:07.620
You'll get kicked out.
You can't do that.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.288
-A pee-pee?

00:03:09.288 --> 00:03:11.958
-Yeah.
-Pee-pee.

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:13.826
-Is that a baby?

00:03:13.826 --> 00:03:15.495
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.495 --> 00:03:17.930
-Everybody staying away
from my pee-pee.

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:20.032
-It's a close quip right now.

00:03:20.032 --> 00:03:21.300
-Okay.
-Oh, snap.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:24.570
-Ooh, look at this,
Kenan in the lead. Mad dog.

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:27.073
-Keep it going.
Hoo, hoo, hoo.

00:03:27.073 --> 00:03:29.242
-Kenan's back. He's back.
He's back.

00:03:29.242 --> 00:03:32.144
-He's barking. Oh, my God.
Ridiculous.

00:03:32.144 --> 00:03:33.947
Round two, here we go.

00:03:33.947 --> 00:03:36.849
Look at your question
on your phone.

00:03:36.849 --> 00:03:38.718
Oh, my God.

00:03:38.718 --> 00:03:41.954
-Oh, that is a corny one.
I just put in a real corny one.

00:03:41.954 --> 00:03:43.222
-So did I. So did I.

00:03:43.222 --> 00:03:45.257
-You're allowed to.
You're allowed to.

00:03:45.257 --> 00:03:46.559
Answers are in.

00:03:46.559 --> 00:03:50.195
Round two, "Surprising photos to
find on Garfield's phone

00:03:50.195 --> 00:03:52.799
