00:03:52.799 --> 00:03:53.866
"A corpse."

00:03:53.866 --> 00:03:56.669
[ Laughter ]

00:03:56.669 --> 00:03:58.738
"Odie's butt."

00:03:58.738 --> 00:04:04.543
[ Laughter ]

00:04:04.543 --> 00:04:07.146
Oh, my gosh.
-It's 50/50.

00:04:07.146 --> 00:04:08.514
A corpse is great.

00:04:08.514 --> 00:04:13.252
-That's so funny.
That's so dark.

00:04:13.252 --> 00:04:16.288
-"The nickname Van Gogh gave
his remaining ear."

00:04:16.288 --> 00:04:17.657
-Get ready for the corn.

00:04:17.657 --> 00:04:18.991
-"Han Solo."

00:04:18.991 --> 00:04:22.195
"Richard G-Ear."
-Richard G-Ear.

00:04:22.195 --> 00:04:26.932
[ Laughter ]

00:04:26.932 --> 00:04:29.669
-Richard G-Ear -- I feel like
that's going to win.

00:04:29.669 --> 00:04:32.572
-That was good.
-Richard G-Ear.

00:04:32.572 --> 00:04:34.440
You're allowed to do
those ones, man.

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:36.575
You know they're going to
get the votes.

00:04:36.575 --> 00:04:37.744
-Yeah. Totally.

00:04:37.744 --> 00:04:40.780
That made me hate myself
writing it in, but...

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:43.015
-Hey, man, we got to win here.
Here we go.

00:04:43.015 --> 00:04:45.952
Current score after round two,
it looks like --

00:04:45.952 --> 00:04:46.952
-Ooh.
-Oh!

00:04:46.952 --> 00:04:50.857
-Oh!
-Come on now.

00:04:50.857 --> 00:04:53.058
-It's rigged!
-Here we go.

00:04:53.058 --> 00:04:54.326
It's not rigged.
-God.

00:04:54.326 --> 00:04:55.761
-Round three is the last lash,

00:04:55.761 --> 00:04:58.064
