00:04:58.064 --> 00:05:00.599
Whoever wins, wins forever.

00:05:00.599 --> 00:05:02.935
-I'm into this game now.

00:05:02.935 --> 00:05:04.536
-Acro-Lash, here we go.

00:05:04.536 --> 00:05:08.641
Last lash goes like this.

00:05:08.641 --> 00:05:11.043
Come up with a full name
for this acronym.

00:05:11.043 --> 00:05:13.112
"M-E-M," full name.

00:05:13.112 --> 00:05:17.182
♪♪

00:05:17.182 --> 00:05:19.552
-Mine's not even
a real sentence.

00:05:19.552 --> 00:05:27.493
♪♪

00:05:27.493 --> 00:05:30.329
-Oh, no, I can't even write it.

00:05:30.329 --> 00:05:33.498
-I don't even know
what I'm doing.

00:05:33.498 --> 00:05:35.567
-We have 15 seconds left.
Oh, no.

00:05:35.567 --> 00:05:37.069
-15 seconds, come on.

00:05:37.069 --> 00:05:40.172
♪♪

00:05:40.172 --> 00:05:42.442
-Rudy! Rudy! Rudy!

00:05:42.442 --> 00:05:45.378
-Come on, come on, come on.

00:05:45.378 --> 00:05:48.280
-3, 2, 1.

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:50.316
-Oh, gosh.

00:05:50.316 --> 00:05:52.285
-Okay, soak it in.

00:05:52.285 --> 00:05:53.486
-Full name for this acronym.

00:05:53.486 --> 00:05:55.487
"Mom eats meth."

00:05:55.487 --> 00:05:58.157
"My end is M."

00:05:58.157 --> 00:06:01.393
"Marvin Ewing Marvin."
-[ Laughs ]

00:06:01.393 --> 00:06:05.230
-"Make every money."

00:06:05.230 --> 00:06:09.935
MEM stands for "Mom eats meth."

00:06:09.935 --> 00:06:13.238
"Marvin Ewing Marvin."

00:06:13.238 --> 00:06:14.740
I think they switched it up
a little bit

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:17.209
