00:06:17.209 --> 00:06:20.512
"My end is M"
and "Make every money."

00:06:20.512 --> 00:06:23.349
[ Laughs ]

00:06:23.349 --> 00:06:24.349
Did everyone vote?

00:06:24.349 --> 00:06:25.951
-Yep.
-6 seconds left.

00:06:25.951 --> 00:06:27.520
-Oh, I think I did.

00:06:30.323 --> 00:06:31.791
-Alright, here we go, guys.

00:06:31.791 --> 00:06:34.093
I couldn't come up with --
my end is --

00:06:34.093 --> 00:06:36.295
I couldn't think of anything.

00:06:36.295 --> 00:06:38.163
Thank you for giving me
that silver.

00:06:38.163 --> 00:06:39.232
-Oh, look at -- Gosh.

00:06:39.232 --> 00:06:41.501
-Oh, look at Whitney.
-Whitney crushed.

00:06:41.501 --> 00:06:44.170
-Mom eats meth.
-That's just my childhood.

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:45.905
