00:07:05.124 --> 00:07:07.293
-Crazy.

00:07:07.293 --> 00:07:09.027
-Oh, my goodness!

00:07:09.027 --> 00:07:11.396
I love you guys.
Thank you so much.

00:07:11.396 --> 00:07:15.634
